sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client EventSource
    participant P as Proxy/TLS
    participant H as WorkHub SSE Handler
    participant B as Event Broker
    participant M as Project Members

    C->>P: GET /api/v1/projects/{id}/events
    P->>H: Forward request + request ID
    H->>H: Authenticate + authorize
    H->>B: Register subscriber
    B-->>H: Heartbeat every 15-30s
    M->>H: PATCH task status via REST
    H->>B: Publish task.updated
    B-->>H: Fan-out to authorized subscribers
    H-->>C: SSE event: task.updated
    C-->>H: Reconnect with Last-Event-ID
    H->>B: Replay or request snapshot
